{"page":470,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:26","surah":40,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ فِرْعَوْنُ ذَرُونِىٓ أَقْتُلْ مُوسَىٰ وَلْيَدْعُ رَبَّهُۥٓ ۖ إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ أَن يُبَدِّلَ دِينَكُمْ أَوْ أَن يُظْهِرَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ٱلْفَسَادَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and Pharaoh said, ‘Leave me to kill Moses- let him call upon his Lord!- for I fear he may cause you to change your religion, or spread disorder in the land.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِرْعَوْنُ","en_gloss":"Firaun","transliteration":"fir'ʿawnu","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ذَرُونِىٓ","en_gloss":"Leave me","transliteration":"dharūnī","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَقْتُلْ","en_gloss":"(so that) I kill","transliteration":"aqtul","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلْيَدْعُ","en_gloss":"and let him call","transliteration":"walyadʿu","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَبَّهُۥٓ ۖ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbahu","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَخَافُ","en_gloss":"[I] fear","transliteration":"akhāfu","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُبَدِّلَ","en_gloss":"he will change","transliteration":"yubaddila","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"دِينَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your religion","transliteration":"dīnakum","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُظْهِرَ","en_gloss":"he may cause to appear","transliteration":"yuẓ'hira","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْفَسَادَ","en_gloss":"the corruption","transliteration":"l-fasāda","verse_key":"40:26"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:26"}]},{"verse_key":"40:27","surah":40,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰٓ إِنِّى عُذْتُ بِرَبِّى وَرَبِّكُم مِّن كُلِّ مُتَكَبِّرٍ لَّا يُؤْمِنُ بِيَوْمِ ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Moses said, ‘I seek refuge with my Lord and yours from every tyrant who refuses to believe in the Day of Reckoning.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عُذْتُ","en_gloss":"[I] seek refuge","transliteration":"ʿudh'tu","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِرَبِّى","en_gloss":"in my Lord","transliteration":"birabbī","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَرَبِّكُم","en_gloss":"and your Lord","transliteration":"warabbikum","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُتَكَبِّرٍۢ","en_gloss":"arrogant one","transliteration":"mutakabbirin","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"who believes","transliteration":"yu'minu","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(in the) Day","transliteration":"biyawmi","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Account","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","verse_key":"40:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:27"}]},{"verse_key":"40:28","surah":40,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ رَجُلٌ مُّؤْمِنٌ مِّنْ ءَالِ فِرْعَوْنَ يَكْ